{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 9, :comments ["<b>Israel</b> — He said: \"trust,\" corresponding to all who trust in them. The son of Balaam said: כי עזרם ומגינם הוא — it should have been עזרכם ומגנכם הוא. But the correct interpretation in my eyes: it is thus — Israel, trust in YHWH, for He is forever Israel's help and their shield, like: מגן עזרך."], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 115, :notes {0 "Resolved 'אמר בן בלעם' as 'the son of Balaam said' (i.e., a named authority, identity uncertain); the construction is elliptical and the reference is inferential."}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:39:44.121437306Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}